  "description": "HopFrame is a lightweight extension library for existing .NET applications that adds **administrative Blazor pages** on top of your current data model. It connects to your configured databases and provides ready-to-use CRUD views so you can **browse, filter, create, update, and delete** data without writing custom admin UIs.",
